<title>USA: Quipp in patent suit against Cannon Equip.</title>
<headline>Quipp in patent suit against Cannon Equip.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quipp Inc unit Quipp Systems Inc said Tuesday it filed a patent infringement lawsuit against privately held Cannon Equipment Co of Cannon Falls, Minnesota.</p>
<p>The suit, filed in the U.S. District Court for the Eastern District of Virginia, claims that Cannon's Series II Newspaper Cart Loader infringes a Quipp patent.</p>
<p>The suit seeks an injunction, damages and other relief, Quipp said.</p>
<p>The patent, issued to Quipp Systems in 1993, covers an automatic system for loading newspaper bundles on carts.</p>
</text>
